			"type": "yaml",
			"value": "title: productionBrowserSourceMaps\ndescription: Enables browser source map generation during the production build."
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Source Maps are enabled by default during development. During production builds, they are disabled to prevent you leaking your source on the client, unless you specifically opt-in with the configuration flag."
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Next.js provides a configuration flag you can use to enable browser source map generation during the production build:"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "code",
			"lang": "js",
			"meta": "filename=\"next.config.js\"",
			"value": "module.exports = {\n\tproductionBrowserSourceMaps: true,\n}"
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "When the "
				},
				{
					"type": "inlineCode",
					"value": "productionBrowserSourceMaps"
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": " option is enabled, the source maps will be output in the same directory as the JavaScript files. Next.js will automatically serve these files when requested."
				}
			]
		},
